# 🔐 Building Legal Hacking Labs: Practice Ethically

## Overview

On Day 7 of my security journey, I learned how to build legal hacking environments. Instead of risking legal consequences by attacking real systems, ethical hackers create controlled labs to sharpen their skills safely.

## Why Build a Hacking Lab?

- ✅ Practice attack techniques legally
- ✅ Understand vulnerabilities hands-on
- ✅ No risk to real systems or data
- ✅ Learn at your own pace
- ✅ Build portfolio for security careers

## Step-by-Step Lab Setup

### Step 1: Install Virtualization Software

```bash
# Option A: VirtualBox (Free)
# Download from virtualbox.org

# Option B: VMware Workstation
# Download from vmware.com

# Option C: Docker for lightweight containers
sudo apt install docker.io
sudo systemctl start docker
```

### Step 2: Download Vulnerable Applications

```bash
# DVWA (Damn Vulnerable Web Application)
git clone https://github.com/digininja/DVWA.git
docker run -d -p 80:80 vulnerables/web-dvwa

# OWASP WebGoat
docker run -p 8080:8080 webgoat/webgoat

# Metasploitable 2 (Download ISO)
# https://sourceforge.net/projects/metasploitable/

# OWASP Juice Shop
docker run -p 3000:3000 bkimminich/juice-shop
```

### Step 3: Set Up Isolated Network

```bash
# Create isolated virtual network
# VirtualBox: Host-Only Adapter
# VMware: Custom VMnet

# Example VirtualBox command
VBoxManage hostonlyif create
VBoxManage hostonlyif ipconfig vboxnet0 --ip 192.168.56.1

# Assign VMs to this network only
# This prevents accidental external connections
```

### Step 4: Install Attack Tools

```bash
# Kali Linux (Pre-built with tools)
# Download from kali.org

# Or install tools individually on Ubuntu:
sudo apt update
sudo apt install nmap nikto sqlmap burpsuite wireshark

# Metasploit Framework
curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/master/msfinstall | sudo sh
```

